<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.832 pct.</title>
<headline>Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.832 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   5.832	 5.83-5.86   5.921</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top five)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield  Range	Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   5.858	5.85-5.86  5.974 (April 2)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 67)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
